      "en": "Personal Gmail for bulk sending = blocked. Use a sending service (Amazon SES, Postmark, Mailgun, Brevo…): one for **transactional** email (invoices, confirmations, passwords) and a separate setup or service for marketing, so marketing reputation does not hurt your invoices."
